This product includes psychometric and cognitive frameworks adapted from:
- International Personality Item Pool (IPIP), public domain representations of the Five-Factor Model.
- O*NET 28.0 Database by the U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration (USDOL/ETA), used under the CC BY 4.0 license.
- Holland's RIASEC vocational typology.
- Higgins Self-Discrepancy Theory (Actual vs. Ideal vs. Ought self dynamics).

Statutory Alignment:
- Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023 (India) - Section 9 (Protection of Children) & Section 11/12 (Data Principal Access & Erasure).
- Crisis helpline directory maintained in alignment with Ministry of Health & Family Welfare (MoHFW) Tele-MANAS, Ministry of Women & Child Development (MWCD) Childline 1098, and Ministry of Home Affairs (MHA) 112 National Emergency Helpline.

